  "description": "“I shall bestow upon you the favor you desire.” \n\nThree months from now. If I don’t receive mana, I will die. There is only one way. To have intercourse just once with someone overflowing with mana.    \n\n“Won’t you please grant me this favor?”    \n“Of course. It is my duty to help those in need.” \n\nThat is how I found a candidate. The High Priest of this land, Cloud Saint. A man even kinder and more virtuous than the rumors suggest.    \n\n“Please… do it until the end.”     \n“You’ve finally become honest again.” \n\nBut for some reason, I feel like I’ve provoked the wrong person. This relationship I started. Will it really be able to end after just once?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14254905)",
